Docker port mapping
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
We need port mapping when you want to access an application running inside a Docker container from outside 
the container, such as from your browser or another application on your Windows machine.
a. docker run -d nginx : need to pull nginx images
b. docker run -d -p 80:80 nginx : create port number
c. http://localhost/ : Open this URL
